 "notes": "Tugaloo Lake quadrangle OFR-156 (Hatcher, mapped 1968-1976; digital 2010). Blue Ridge, Chauga belt/Inner Piedmont and Alto allochthon units with ages as printed. Several map symbols garbled in OCR and left out rather than guessed. ADCOH 4 shallow core hole on the map face (no log printed). Metamorphic isograd inset (upper/lower kyanite, garnet-staurolite, retrograde overprint). Strike/dip and fold symbols without coordinates. SUBSURFACE: sections interpretive; units along not itemized.",
